      "story_index": 2,
      "sentence_id": "s10"
    },
    {
      "type": "zh",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "第 3 則新聞：美國通膨指標創 2023 年以來新高",
      "start_sec": 273.445,
      "end_sec": 278.105,
      "audio_file": "/home/runner/work/daily-news-english/daily-news-english/.tts_cache/b24ba05208b7ef43bbc3322a7e2830f401771facb60065ae4a7954bdc0610667.wav",
      "story_index": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "en",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "The Federal Reserve's preferred inflation gauge recently showed a significant increase.",
      "start_sec": 278.705,
      "end_sec": 284.793,
      "audio_file": "/home/runner/work/daily-news-english/daily-news-english/.tts_cache/40ae72eecc2e17cf7f77f97df0edc5a0810910f870f79c5b9427bc02f980f632.wav",
      "story_index": 3,
      "sentence_id": "s11"
    },
    {
      "type": "zh",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "聯邦準備理事會偏好的通膨衡量標準近期顯著上升。",
      "start_sec": 285.593,
      "end_sec": 290.683,
