      "audio_file": "/home/runner/work/daily-news-english/daily-news-english/.tts_cache/d685c226446d54abd19a685d1efd465e6cd24703a387cc1863faae1ecbccd615.wav",
      "story_index": 3,
      "sentence_id": "s12"
    },
    {
      "type": "zh",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "核心個人消費支出（PCE）通膨率上升至百分之三點三。",
      "start_sec": 319.713,
      "end_sec": 325.394,
      "audio_file": "/home/runner/work/daily-news-english/daily-news-english/.tts_cache/7e8bd19424c1a1bc04aa5e4217d786da3f3febaf959e0e4ff555416a96df500b.wav",
      "story_index": 3,
      "sentence_id": "s12"
    },
    {
      "type": "en",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "This is the fastest annual rate observed since late 2023.",
      "start_sec": 325.994,
      "end_sec": 330.891,
      "audio_file": "/home/runner/work/daily-news-english/daily-news-english/.tts_cache/12d24e33ed1cd5e11b8185803ac4f06cd76de383b407cce95f8cc7abe43d3b1f.wav",
      "story_index": 3,
      "sentence_id": "s13"
    },
    {
      "type": "zh",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "這是自 2023 年底以來觀察到的最快年增率。",
      "start_sec": 331.691,
      "end_sec": 335.922,
      "audio_file": "/home/runner/work/daily-news-english/daily-news-english/.tts_cache/c5c2f4b71b2178ae8857acc57aa5b64fbdfda0ed037938f90690c766cf4ba579.wav",
      "story_index": 3,
      "sentence_id": "s13"
    },
    {
      "type": "en",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Tariffs and strong AI-driven demand are pushing prices up.",
